{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1787093019","published":"2026-08-18T22:43:49Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:52.620483708Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-1519"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-1519","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: a resolver performing DNSSEC validation could consume excessive CPU on a maliciously crafted zone (unbounded NSEC3 iterations when validating referrals to unsigned delegations)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-1519.patch: a resolver performing DNSSEC validation could consume excessive CPU on a maliciously crafted zone (unbounded NSEC3 iterations when validating referrals to unsigned delegations)\n     - CVE-2026-1519\n   * Build the lib/dns \"gen\" host tool with large-file support to fix an\n     armel FTBFS: \"gen\" scans the rdata directories with a non-LFS readdir(),\n     which aborts with EOVERFLOW on 64-bit inodes/offsets on 32-bit\n     architectures.  next_file() in lib/dns/gen-unix.h treats the resulting\n     NULL as end-of-directory, so the scan was silently truncated and \"gen\"\n     emitted an incomplete include/dns/rdatastruct.h.\n     - debian/patches/gen-build-largefile-source.patch","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind9","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/bind9?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:9.11.5.P4+dfsg-5.1+deb10u11+tuxcare.els4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1787093019.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/bind9-doc?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:9.11.5.P4+dfsg-5.1+deb10u11+tuxcare.els4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1787093019.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9-host","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/bind9-host?distro=debia